  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.BroadcastChannel.bc_degraded_capacity_eq_uv", "./",
   "The capacity region of a physically degraded broadcast channel whose transition law gives\x0aevery output pair positive mass is its UV outer region.  Degradedness is the strongest of the\x0athree comparisons, so the single-letter characterization of a more capable channel applies with\x0ano further analysis. ",
   "<p>The capacity region of a physically degraded broadcast channel whose transition law gives\x0aevery output pair positive mass is its UV outer region.  Degradedness is the strongest of the\x0athree comparisons, so the single-letter characterization of a more capable channel applies with\x0ano further analysis.</p>"),
