  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.KL_le_chi_square_finset", "../.././",
   "KL upper bound via χ² (Gibbs/Pinsker): on a finite alphabet with\x0a`∑ p = ∑ q`, `KL(p‖q) := ∑ p · log(p/q) ≤ ∑ (p-q)² / q`. ",
   "<p>KL upper bound via χ² (Gibbs/Pinsker): on a finite alphabet with\x0a<code>∑ p = ∑ q</code>, <code>KL(p‖q) := ∑ p · log(p/q) ≤ ∑ (p-q)² / q</code>.</p>"),
