  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.entropyPowerExt_mixed_add_ge_symm_of_regular", "./",
   "Case 2 symmetric (`Y` a.c., `X` singular): `N(X+Y) ≥ N(X) + N(Y)`. Re-applies\x0a`entropyPowerExt_mixed_add_ge_of_regular` with `X` and `Y` swapped via `X + Y = Y + X`, passing\x0a`hY_ent` / `hWyx_ent` into the `X`-role positions. The integrability and finite-entropy hypotheses\x0aare regularity preconditions for the `Y+X` path.\x0a\x0a@audit:superseded-by(entropyPowerExt_add_ge) Replaced by the unconditional\x0a`entropyPowerExt_mixed_add_ge_symm`; retained as a proof-done leaf reachable only from the\x0adead dispatch skeleton.\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "<p>Case 2 symmetric (<code>Y</code> a.c., <code>X</code> singular): <code>N(X+Y) ≥ N(X) + N(Y)</code>. Re-applies\x0a<code>entropyPowerExt_mixed_add_ge_of_regular</code> with <code>X</code> and <code>Y</code> swapped via <code>X + Y = Y + X</code>, passing\x0a<code>hY_ent</code> / <code>hWyx_ent</code> into the <code>X</code>-role positions. The integrability and finite-entropy hypotheses\x0aare regularity preconditions for the <code>Y+X</code> path.</p><p>@audit:superseded-by(entropyPowerExt_add_ge) Replaced by the unconditional\x0a<code>entropyPowerExt_mixed_add_ge_symm</code>; retained as a proof-done leaf reachable only from the\x0adead dispatch skeleton.\x0a@audit:ok</p>"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.entropyPowerExt_mono_add", ".././",
   "Unconditional gateway atom: `W` a.c. and `W ⊥ V ⟹ N(W+V) ≥ N(W)`. Lifts\x0a`differentialEntropyExt_mono_add` along `EReal.exp_monotone` to `entropyPowerExt`.\x0a\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "<p>Unconditional gateway atom: <code>W</code> a.c. and <code>W ⊥ V ⟹ N(W+V) ≥ N(W)</code>. Lifts\x0a<code>differentialEntropyExt_mono_add</code> along <code>EReal.exp_monotone</code> to <code>entropyPowerExt</code>.</p><p>@audit:ok</p>"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.FisherInfo.integrable_sq_mul_gaussianPDFReal", "../.././",
