  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.HoeffdingLagrange.isHoeffdingTiltMinimal_realises", ".././",
   "Bridge (minimal ⇒ realises): when the tilt at `lam` lies in `K(α)` and\x0aminimises `klDivPmf · P₂` on `K(α)`, it realises the infimum\x0a`hoeffdingE2 P₁ P₂ alpha`. Discharged via the `sInf` characterisation. ",
   "<p>Bridge (minimal ⇒ realises): when the tilt at <code>lam</code> lies in <code>K(α)</code> and\x0aminimises <code>klDivPmf · P₂</code> on <code>K(α)</code>, it realises the infimum\x0a<code>hoeffdingE2 P₁ P₂ alpha</code>. Discharged via the <code>sInf</code> characterisation.</p>"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.Hoeffding.Sandwich module doc 2", "../.././",
