  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.edgeBoundary_ge_AMGM", ".././",
   "The edge-isoperimetric lower bound: for nonempty `A ⊆ Fin n → Bool`,\x0a`2 * n * (A.card)^((n-1)/n) ≤ edgeBoundaryCount A + n * A.card`, the additive form of\x0a`|∂_e A| ≥ 2n · |A|^{(n-1)/n} − n · |A|`. ",
   "<p>The edge-isoperimetric lower bound: for nonempty <code>A ⊆ Fin n → Bool</code>,\x0a<code>2 * n * (A.card)^((n-1)/n) ≤ edgeBoundaryCount A + n * A.card</code>, the additive form of\x0a<code>|∂_e A| ≥ 2n · |A|^{(n-1)/n} − n · |A|</code>.</p>"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.IIDProductInput.Basic module doc 3", "../.././",
   "### `IdentDistrib` along each axis ",
   "<h3 id=\"IdentDistrib-along-each-axis\" class=\"markdown-heading\"><code>IdentDistrib</code> along each axis <a class=\"hover-link\" href=\"#IdentDistrib-along-each-axis\">#</a></h3>"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.KLDivContinuous module doc 0", "./",
   "# KL divergence in vector form and its continuity\x0a\x0a`klDivSumForm_ofVec p q := ∑ a, p a * (log (p a) - log (q a))` and its continuity in `p`\x0aunder the Pi topology on `α → ℝ` (finite `α`).\x0a\x0a## Main definitions\x0a\x0a* `klDivSumForm_ofVec` — KL divergence taking `α → ℝ` inputs.\x0a\x0a## Main statements\x0a\x0a* `klDivSumForm_ofVec_continuous` — continuous in `p` when `q a > 0` for all `a`.\x0a* `klDivIndex_eq_ofVec` — `klDivIndex c n Q = klDivSumForm_ofVec (c/n) (Q.real ∘ singleton)`.\x0a",
   "<h1 id=\"KL-divergence-in-vector-form-and-its-continuity\" class=\"markdown-heading\">KL divergence in vector form and its continuity <a class=\"hover-link\" href=\"#KL-divergence-in-vector-form-and-its-continuity\">#</a></h1><p><code>klDivSumForm_ofVec p q := ∑ a, p a * (log (p a) - log (q a))</code> and its continuity in <code>p</code>\x0aunder the Pi topology on <code>α → ℝ</code> (finite <code>α</code>).</p><h2 id=\"Main-definitions\" class=\"markdown-heading\">Main definitions <a class=\"hover-link\" href=\"#Main-definitions\">#</a></h2><ul><li><code>klDivSumForm_ofVec</code> — KL divergence taking <code>α → ℝ</code> inputs.</li></ul><h2 id=\"Main-statements\" class=\"markdown-heading\">Main statements <a class=\"hover-link\" href=\"#Main-statements\">#</a></h2><ul><li><code>klDivSumForm_ofVec_continuous</code> — continuous in <code>p</code> when <code>q a &gt; 0</code> for all <code>a</code>.</li><li><code>klDivIndex_eq_ofVec</code> — <code>klDivIndex c n Q = klDivSumForm_ofVec (c/n) (Q.real ∘ singleton)</code>.</li></ul>"),
