  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.per_source_typical_match_prob_strong_ge", "../.././",
   "Step A: repackage `conditionalStronglyTypicalSlice_mass_ge` for the\x0arandom-coding chain. For `x` X-strongly-typical (eventually in `n`), the\x0aprobability under the Y-product measure that a random `y` lands in the joint\x0astrong slice at `x` is bounded below by `exp(-n · (H(X) + H(Y) - H(Z) + slack))`. ",
   "<p>Step A: repackage <code>conditionalStronglyTypicalSlice_mass_ge</code> for the\x0arandom-coding chain. For <code>x</code> X-strongly-typical (eventually in <code>n</code>), the\x0aprobability under the Y-product measure that a random <code>y</code> lands in the joint\x0astrong slice at <code>x</code> is bounded below by <code>exp(-n · (H(X) + H(Y) - H(Z) + slack))</code>.</p>"),
