⟂ᵢ[μ] Xs j)\"]],[\"normal\",\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"∀ i, IdentDistrib (Xs i) (Xs 0) μ μ\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"The \"],[\"code\",[\"(· ⟂ᵢ[μ] ·) on Xs\"]],[\"normal\",\" anonymous-lambda form fails to parse when combined with\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"on\"]],[\"normal\",\", so the explicit \"],[\"code\",[\"fun i j => …\"]],[\"normal\",\" form is used.\"]]]]"),
