  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.AWGN.AchievabilityCodeExistence module doc 0", 8044,
   "# AWGN achievability assembly\x0a\x0aThe assembled achievability statement for the AWGN channel coding theorem\x0a(Cover–Thomas 9.2, Theorem 9.1.1): combining the random Gaussian codebook, the\x0ajoint-typicality decoder and union bound, the power-constraint witness, and\x0aworst-half expurgation into the existence of good `(M, n)` codes for any rate\x0abelow the Gaussian capacity.\x0a\x0a## Main statements\x0a\x0a* `isAwgnTypicalityHypothesis` — the assembled achievability statement consumed\x0a  by the headline `awgn_achievability`.\x0a",
   "[[\"header\",1,[[\"normal\",\"AWGN achievability assembly\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The assembled achievability statement for the AWGN channel coding theorem\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"(Cover–Thomas 9.2, Theorem 9.1.1): combining the random Gaussian codebook, the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"joint-typicality decoder and union bound, the power-constraint witness, and\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"worst-half expurgation into the existence of good \"],[\"code\",[\"(M, n)\"]],[\"normal\",\" codes for any rate\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"below the Gaussian capacity.\"]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Main statements\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"isAwgnTypicalityHypothesis\"]],[\"normal\",\" — the assembled achievability statement consumed\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"by the headline \"],[\"code\",[\"awgn_achievability\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.AWGN.AchievabilityTypicalDecoder module doc 1", 8044,
