  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.AWGN.awgnConverseMarkov_holds", 8044,
   "Markov chain `W → encoder ∘ W → Y^n` factorization.\x0a\x0a`IsMarkovChain (converseJointInline h_meas c) Prod.fst (encoder ∘ fst) Prod.snd`, the\x0ajoint factorization.\x0a\x0aThe argument starts from the identity `μ = (μ.map fst) ⊗ₘ (W.comap encoder)` (with `μ` the\x0amessage-space marginal and `W := Channel.toBlock (awgnChannel N) n` the noise block kernel),\x0aestablished on the mixture-of-diracs via `ext_of_lintegral` (`h_marginalA`). From it,\x0a`condDistrib Yo Zc μ =ᵐ W` (`condDistrib_ae_eq_of_measure_eq_compProd`); then `condDistrib Xs Zc μ`\x0ais absorbed via `compProd_map_condDistrib`, and the triple-joint factorization is verified by\x0a`ext_of_lintegral` + the `h_marginalA` reduction (precedent:\x0a`BlockwiseChannel.isMarkovChain_per_letter_input`).\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Markov chain \"],[\"code\",[\"W → encoder ∘ W → Y^n\"]],[\"normal\",\" factorization.\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"IsMarkovChain (converseJointInline h_meas c) Prod.fst (encoder ∘ fst) Prod.snd\"]],[\"normal\",\", the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"joint factorization.\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The argument starts from the identity \"],[\"code\",[\"μ = (μ.map fst) ⊗ₘ (W.comap encoder)\"]],[\"normal\",\" (with \"],[\"code\",[\"μ\"]],[\"normal\",\" the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"message-space marginal and \"],[\"code\",[\"W := Channel.toBlock (awgnChannel N) n\"]],[\"normal\",\" the noise block kernel),\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"established on the mixture-of-diracs via \"],[\"code\",[\"ext_of_lintegral\"]],[\"normal\",\" (\"],[\"code\",[\"h_marginalA\"]],[\"normal\",\"). From it,\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"condDistrib Yo Zc μ =ᵐ W\"]],[\"normal\",\" (\"],[\"code\",[\"condDistrib_ae_eq_of_measure_eq_compProd\"]],[\"normal\",\"); then \"],[\"code\",[\"condDistrib Xs Zc μ\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"is absorbed via \"],[\"code\",[\"compProd_map_condDistrib\"]],[\"normal\",\", and the triple-joint factorization is verified by\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"ext_of_lintegral\"]],[\"normal\",\" + the \"],[\"code\",[\"h_marginalA\"]],[\"normal\",\" reduction (precedent:\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"BlockwiseChannel.isMarkovChain_per_letter_input\"]],[\"normal\",\").\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"@audit:ok\"]]]]"),
