  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.BroadcastChannel.csiszar_sum_identity", 8044,
   "**Csiszár sum identity** (the key ingredient of the `R₁`-side bound): for any two\x0afinite-alphabet sequences `As`, `Bs` over `Fin n`,\x0a`∑ᵢ I(A^{i-1}; Bᵢ | B_{i+1}ⁿ) = ∑ᵢ I(B_{i+1}ⁿ; Aᵢ | A^{i-1})`.\x0a\x0aHere `A^{i-1}` is the *prefix* `fun j : Fin i.val ↦ Aⱼ` and `B_{i+1}ⁿ` is the *suffix*\x0a`fun j : {j : Fin n // i.val < j.val} ↦ Bⱼ`. Both sides expand (via the prefix chain rule\x0a`condMutualInfo_prefix_chain_rule` for the left, the reflection-based suffix chain rule\x0a`condMutualInfo_suffix_chain_rule` for the right) to the common triangular double sum\x0a`∑_{k<i} I(Aₖ; Bᵢ | A^{k-1}, B_{i+1}ⁿ)`, matched termwise by `condMutualInfo_comm` plus a\x0a`prodComm` relabel of the conditioner (El Gamal–Kim).\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"strong\",[[\"normal\",\"Csiszár sum identity\"]]],[\"normal\",\" (the key ingredient of the \"],[\"code\",[\"R₁\"]],[\"normal\",\"-side bound): for any two\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"finite-alphabet sequences \"],[\"code\",[\"As\"]],[\"normal\",\", \"],[\"code\",[\"Bs\"]],[\"normal\",\" over \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin n\"]],[\"normal\",\",\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"∑ᵢ I(A^{i-1}; Bᵢ | B_{i+1}ⁿ) = ∑ᵢ I(B_{i+1}ⁿ; Aᵢ | A^{i-1})\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Here \"],[\"code\",[\"A^{i-1}\"]],[\"normal\",\" is the \"],[\"em\",[[\"normal\",\"prefix\"]]],[\"normal\",\" \"],[\"code\",[\"fun j : Fin i.val ↦ Aⱼ\"]],[\"normal\",\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"B_{i+1}ⁿ\"]],[\"normal\",\" is the \"],[\"em\",[[\"normal\",\"suffix\"]]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"fun j : {j : Fin n // i.val < j.val} ↦ Bⱼ\"]],[\"normal\",\". Both sides expand (via the prefix chain rule\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"condMutualInfo_prefix_chain_rule\"]],[\"normal\",\" for the left, the reflection-based suffix chain rule\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"condMutualInfo_suffix_chain_rule\"]],[\"normal\",\" for the right) to the common triangular double sum\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"∑_{k<i} I(Aₖ; Bᵢ | A^{k-1}, B_{i+1}ⁿ)\"]],[\"normal\",\", matched termwise by \"],[\"code\",[\"condMutualInfo_comm\"]],[\"normal\",\" plus a\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"prodComm\"]],[\"normal\",\" relabel of the conditioner (El Gamal–Kim).\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"@audit:ok\"]]]]"),
