  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.ChannelCoding.ShannonTheoremGeneral module doc 0", 8044,
   "# Shannon noisy channel coding theorem — smoothing infrastructure\x0a\x0aSmoothing infrastructure for the Shannon noisy channel coding theorem without the\x0afull-support assumption `hW_pos`. The smoothed channel is\x0a`Channel.smooth W δ a := (1-δ) · W a + δ · uniformMeasureβ`.\x0a\x0a## Main definitions\x0a\x0a* `uniformMeasureβ β`: uniform probability measure on a finite type `β`.\x0a* `Channel.smooth W δ`: convex combination of `W` with the uniform output measure.\x0a\x0a## Main statements\x0a\x0a* `exists_smooth_capacity_gt`: from `R < capacity W`, extracts `δ_B > 0` and `R₁ > R`\x0a  with `R₁ < capacity (W_smooth δ)` for all `δ ∈ (0, δ_B]`.\x0a* `errorProbAt_smooth_TV`: TV bound `|errorProbAt(W_smooth δ) - errorProbAt(W)| ≤ 2 n δ`.\x0a\x0a## Implementation notes\x0a\x0aThe main theorem `shannon_noisy_channel_coding_theorem_general` is in\x0a`ShannonTheoremMaxError`, which imports this file for the smoothing infrastructure.\x0a",
   "[[\"header\",1,[[\"normal\",\"Shannon noisy channel coding theorem — smoothing infrastructure\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Smoothing infrastructure for the Shannon noisy channel coding theorem without the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"full-support assumption \"],[\"code\",[\"hW_pos\"]],[\"normal\",\". The smoothed channel is\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"Channel.smooth W δ a := (1-δ) · W a + δ · uniformMeasureβ\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Main definitions\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"uniformMeasureβ β\"]],[\"normal\",\": uniform probability measure on a finite type \"],[\"code\",[\"β\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"Channel.smooth W δ\"]],[\"normal\",\": convex combination of \"],[\"code\",[\"W\"]],[\"normal\",\" with the uniform output measure.\"]]]]]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Main statements\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"exists_smooth_capacity_gt\"]],[\"normal\",\": from \"],[\"code\",[\"R < capacity W\"]],[\"normal\",\", extracts \"],[\"code\",[\"δ_B > 0\"]],[\"normal\",\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"R₁ > R\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"with \"],[\"code\",[\"R₁ < capacity (W_smooth δ)\"]],[\"normal\",\" for all \"],[\"code\",[\"δ ∈ (0, δ_B]\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"errorProbAt_smooth_TV\"]],[\"normal\",\": TV bound \"],[\"code\",[\"|errorProbAt(W_smooth δ) - errorProbAt(W)| ≤ 2 n δ\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Implementation notes\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The main theorem \"],[\"code\",[\"shannon_noisy_channel_coding_theorem_general\"]],[\"normal\",\" is in\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"ShannonTheoremMaxError\"]],[\"normal\",\", which imports this file for the smoothing infrastructure.\"]]]]"),
