  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.StamInequality.stam_lambda_min", 8044,
   "The λ-optimization closed form (Stam Step 4).\x0a\x0aFor positive `a, b > 0`, the function `λ ↦ λ² a + (1 - λ)² b` is minimized at\x0a`λ* = b / (a + b)` with minimum value `a b / (a + b)`. Combined with Step 3,\x0athis gives `J(Z) ≤ J(X) J(Y) / (J(X) + J(Y))`, equivalently\x0a`1 / J(Z) ≥ 1 / J(X) + 1 / J(Y)`. ",
