  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.Gambling.condDoublingRate_le_proportional", 8044,
   "Proportional (Kelly) betting on each observed value of the side information maximizes\x0athe conditional doubling rate: for any full-support strategy `b` and positive odds `o`,\x0a`W(b | Y) ≤ W(pXgivenY | Y)`. This is the conditional step towards Cover–Thomas\x0aTheorem 6.1.3.\x0asorryAx-free (`[propext, Classical.choice,\x0aQuot.sound]`); per-`y` reuse of `doublingRate_le_proportional` weighted by\x0a`pY y ≥ 0`, no bundling. All hypotheses are regularity preconditions (`hpY`/`hcond` pmf,\x0a`hb`/`hb_pos` full-support bet, `ho` positive odds), none load-bearing.\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Proportional (Kelly) betting on each observed value of the side information maximizes\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"the conditional doubling rate: for any full-support strategy \"],[\"code\",[\"b\"]],[\"normal\",\" and positive odds \"],[\"code\",[\"o\"]],[\"normal\",\",\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"W(b | Y) ≤ W(pXgivenY | Y)\"]],[\"normal\",\". This is the conditional step towards Cover–Thomas\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"Theorem 6.1.3.\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"sorryAx-free (\"],[\"code\",[\"[propext, Classical.choice,\",\" \",\"Quot.sound]\"]],[\"normal\",\"); per-\"],[\"code\",[\"y\"]],[\"normal\",\" reuse of \"],[\"code\",[\"doublingRate_le_proportional\"]],[\"normal\",\" weighted by\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"pY y ≥ 0\"]],[\"normal\",\", no bundling. All hypotheses are regularity preconditions (\"],[\"code\",[\"hpY\"]],[\"normal\",\"/\"],[\"code\",[\"hcond\"]],[\"normal\",\" pmf,\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"hb\"]],[\"normal\",\"/\"],[\"code\",[\"hb_pos\"]],[\"normal\",\" full-support bet, \"],[\"code\",[\"ho\"]],[\"normal\",\" positive odds), none load-bearing.\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"@audit:ok\"]]]]"),
