  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.MinkowskiDet module doc 0", 8044,
   "# Minkowski determinant inequality (Cover-Thomas Theorem 17.9.1)\x0a\x0aFor positive-definite matrices `A, B : Matrix n n ℝ`,\x0a`det(A + B)^(1/n) ≥ det A^(1/n) + det B^(1/n)`.\x0a\x0aProved by simultaneous diagonalization / congruence reduction. The proof is assembled\x0afrom the matrix square root (`CFC.sqrt`), congruence PosDef preservation, the\x0aeigenvalue-shift determinant identity `det (1 + S) = ∏ (1 + eigenvalues S i)`\x0a(`det_one_add_eq_prod_one_add_eigenvalues`), and the scalar geometric-mean\x0asuperadditivity bound (`geom_mean_superadditive`).\x0a\x0a## References\x0a\x0a* T. M. Cover and J. A. Thomas, *Elements of Information Theory* (2nd ed.), Wiley, 2006. Theorem 17.9.1.\x0a",
   "[[\"header\",1,[[\"normal\",\"Minkowski determinant inequality (Cover-Thomas Theorem 17.9.1)\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"For positive-definite matrices \"],[\"code\",[\"A, B : Matrix n n ℝ\"]],[\"normal\",\",\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"det(A + B)^(1/n) ≥ det A^(1/n) + det B^(1/n)\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Proved by simultaneous diagonalization / congruence reduction. The proof is assembled\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"from the matrix square root (\"],[\"code\",[\"CFC.sqrt\"]],[\"normal\",\"), congruence PosDef preservation, the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"eigenvalue-shift determinant identity \"],[\"code\",[\"det (1 + S) = ∏ (1 + eigenvalues S i)\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"(\"],[\"code\",[\"det_one_add_eq_prod_one_add_eigenvalues\"]],[\"normal\",\"), and the scalar geometric-mean\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"superadditivity bound (\"],[\"code\",[\"geom_mean_superadditive\"]],[\"normal\",\").\"]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"References\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"T. M. Cover and J. A. Thomas, \"],[\"em\",[[\"normal\",\"Elements of Information Theory\"]]],[\"normal\",\" (2nd ed.), Wiley, 2006. Theorem 17.9.1.\"]]]]]]]]"),
