   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Codebook-average swap for the user-1 alias event \"],[\"code\",[\"E1\"]],[\"normal\",\": the two-codebook average of the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"event that a wrong user-1 codeword (\"],[\"code\",[\"m₁' ≠ m₁\"]],[\"normal\",\", user 2 correct) is jointly typical with the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"output is bounded by \"],[\"code\",[\"exp(n·(−I(X₁;(X₂,Y)) + 3ε))\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.MAC.macJTS_indep_prob_le_both", 8044,
   "Conditional independent-pair bound for both users, controlling the `E3` alias event:\x0awhen the pair of codewords `(X̃₁, X̃₂)` is drawn independently of the output block `Y`, the\x0aprobability that the (reshuffled) triple lands in the three-way jointly typical set is at\x0amost `exp(n·(H(X₁,X₂,Y) − H(X₁,X₂) − H(Y) + 3ε))`.\x0a\x0aThis is the direct three-axis analogue of the single-user independent-pair bound, with the\x0a`(X₁,X₂)` axes grouped as the \"input\" and `Y` as the \"output\".  Combined with input\x0aindependence (downstream) the exponent equals `exp(-n·(I(X₁,X₂;Y) − 3ε))`.\x0a\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Conditional independent-pair bound for both users, controlling the \"],[\"code\",[\"E3\"]],[\"normal\",\" alias event:\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"when the pair of codewords \"],[\"code\",[\"(X̃₁, X̃₂)\"]],[\"normal\",\" is drawn independently of the output block \"],[\"code\",[\"Y\"]],[\"normal\",\", the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"probability that the (reshuffled) triple lands in the three-way jointly typical set is at\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"most \"],[\"code\",[\"exp(n·(H(X₁,X₂,Y) − H(X₁,X₂) − H(Y) + 3ε))\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"This is the direct three-axis analogue of the single-user independent-pair bound, with the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"(X₁,X₂)\"]],[\"normal\",\" axes grouped as the \\\"input\\\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"Y\"]],[\"normal\",\" as the \\\"output\\\".  Combined with input\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"independence (downstream) the exponent equals \"],[\"code\",[\"exp(-n·(I(X₁,X₂;Y) − 3ε))\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"@audit:ok\"]]]]"),
