  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.ParallelGaussian.isWaterFillingOptimal_of_kkt", 8044,
   "**Water-filling optimality**. Given a KKT water level `ν`\x0a(`h_kkt : ∑ max(0, ν - N_i) = P`), the water-filling allocation `P_i^* = max(0, ν - N_i)`\x0amaximizes the per-coordinate sum `∑ (1/2) log(1 + P_i / N_i)` over the feasible set\x0a`{P' | ∀ i, 0 ≤ P'_i ∧ ∑_i P'_i ≤ P}`, i.e. `IsWaterFillingOptimal P N ν`.\x0a\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"strong\",[[\"normal\",\"Water-filling optimality\"]]],[\"normal\",\". Given a KKT water level \"],[\"code\",[\"ν\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"(\"],[\"code\",[\"h_kkt : ∑ max(0, ν - N_i) = P\"]],[\"normal\",\"), the water-filling allocation \"],[\"code\",[\"P_i^* = max(0, ν - N_i)\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"maximizes the per-coordinate sum \"],[\"code\",[\"∑ (1/2) log(1 + P_i / N_i)\"]],[\"normal\",\" over the feasible set\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"{P' | ∀ i, 0 ≤ P'_i ∧ ∑_i P'_i ≤ P}\"]],[\"normal\",\", i.e. \"],[\"code\",[\"IsWaterFillingOptimal P N ν\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"@audit:ok\"]]]]"),
