  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.RateDistortion.AchievabilityAsymptoticFailureDecay module doc 0", 8044,
   "# Rate-distortion achievability — asymptotic decay and distortion decomposition\x0a\x0aThe asymptotic part of the rate-distortion achievability argument: from the\x0aper-`n` bounds (joint-typicality probability `≥ (1-η)·exp(-n·θ)`, codebook size\x0a`M_n ≥ ⌈exp(n·R)⌉`, and the source-averaged failure bound\x0a`(1 - p_typ)^M ≤ exp(-M · p_typ)`), the random-coding failure probability tends\x0ato `0` provided `R > θ ≥ 0`. Also provides the distortion decomposition of the\x0ajoint-typical encoder into the within-`δ` and worst-case branches.\x0a\x0a## Main definitions\x0a\x0a* `distortionMax d` — the worst-case single-letter distortion, an absolute upper\x0a  bound on `blockDistortion`.\x0a\x0a## Main statements\x0a\x0a* `ceil_exp_mul_exp_neg_tendsto_atTop` — `M_n · exp(-nθ) → ∞` when `R > θ`.\x0a* `exp_neg_tendsto_zero_of_tendsto_atTop` — `f n → ∞ ⟹ exp(-f n) → 0`.\x0a* `blockDistortion_le_distortionMax` — `blockDistortion ≤ distortionMax`.\x0a* `source_avg_distortion_le_simpler` — codebook-fixed Bochner-integral form of\x0a  the distortion decomposition: `∫ x, blockDistortion ∂P_X` is bounded by\x0a  `(𝔼d + δ) + distortionMax · Pr(encoder fails distortion-typicality)`.\x0a",
   "[[\"header\",1,[[\"normal\",\"Rate-distortion achievability — asymptotic decay and distortion decomposition\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The asymptotic part of the rate-distortion achievability argument: from the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"per-\"],[\"code\",[\"n\"]],[\"normal\",\" bounds (joint-typicality probability \"],[\"code\",[\"≥ (1-η)·exp(-n·θ)\"]],[\"normal\",\", codebook size\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"M_n ≥ ⌈exp(n·R)⌉\"]],[\"normal\",\", and the source-averaged failure bound\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"(1 - p_typ)^M ≤ exp(-M · p_typ)\"]],[\"normal\",\"), the random-coding failure probability tends\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"to \"],[\"code\",[\"0\"]],[\"normal\",\" provided \"],[\"code\",[\"R > θ ≥ 0\"]],[\"normal\",\". Also provides the distortion decomposition of the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"joint-typical encoder into the within-\"],[\"code\",[\"δ\"]],[\"normal\",\" and worst-case branches.\"]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Main definitions\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"distortionMax d\"]],[\"normal\",\" — the worst-case single-letter distortion, an absolute upper\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"bound on \"],[\"code\",[\"blockDistortion\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Main statements\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"ceil_exp_mul_exp_neg_tendsto_atTop\"]],[\"normal\",\" — \"],[\"code\",[\"M_n · exp(-nθ) → ∞\"]],[\"normal\",\" when \"],[\"code\",[\"R > θ\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"exp_neg_tendsto_zero_of_tendsto_atTop\"]],[\"normal\",\" — \"],[\"code\",[\"f n → ∞ ⟹ exp(-f n) → 0\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"blockDistortion_le_distortionMax\"]],[\"normal\",\" — \"],[\"code\",[\"blockDistortion ≤ distortionMax\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"source_avg_distortion_le_simpler\"]],[\"normal\",\" — codebook-fixed Bochner-integral form of\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"the distortion decomposition: \"],[\"code\",[\"∫ x, blockDistortion ∂P_X\"]],[\"normal\",\" is bounded by\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"(𝔼d + δ) + distortionMax · Pr(encoder fails distortion-typicality)\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.RateDistortion.AchievabilityCodebookMatchProbability module doc 0", 8044,
   "# Rate-distortion achievability — codebook-level match probability\x0a\x0aLower bounds on the probability that some codeword of an i.i.d. product codebook\x0ais jointly typical with a source word, and the source-averaged failure\x0aprobability obtained by integrating over the source distribution.\x0a\x0a## Main statements\x0a\x0a* `codebook_indep_no_match_prob_eq` — under the product measure\x0a  `Measure.pi (fun _ : Fin M => p)`, the probability that no codeword matches `x`\x0a  factors as `(1 - p.real {y | (x, y) ∈ JTS}) ^ M`.\x0a* `single_codeword_typical_match_prob` — the probability that some codeword\x0a  matches `x` is at least `1 - (1 - p.real {y | (x, y) ∈ JTS}) ^ M`.\x0a* `encoder_failure_prob_le_exp_neg_M_avg` — exponentialization of the\x0a  source-averaged failure-pow bound.\x0a",
   "[[\"header\",1,[[\"normal\",\"Rate-distortion achievability — codebook-level match probability\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Lower bounds on the probability that some codeword of an i.i.d. product codebook\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"is jointly typical with a source word, and the source-averaged failure\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"probability obtained by integrating over the source distribution.\"]]],[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Main statements\"]]],[\"ul\",true,\"*\",[[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"codebook_indep_no_match_prob_eq\"]],[\"normal\",\" — under the product measure\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"Measure.pi (fun _ : Fin M => p)\"]],[\"normal\",\", the probability that no codeword matches \"],[\"code\",[\"x\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"factors as \"],[\"code\",[\"(1 - p.real {y | (x, y) ∈ JTS}) ^ M\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"single_codeword_typical_match_prob\"]],[\"normal\",\" — the probability that some codeword\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"matches \"],[\"code\",[\"x\"]],[\"normal\",\" is at least \"],[\"code\",[\"1 - (1 - p.real {y | (x, y) ∈ JTS}) ^ M\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]],[false,null,null,[[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"encoder_failure_prob_le_exp_neg_M_avg\"]],[\"normal\",\" — exponentialization of the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"source-averaged failure-pow bound.\"]]]]]]]]"),
