  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.jointStronglyTypicalSet", 8044,
   "Joint strongly typical set over the product alphabet `α × β`. A pair\x0a`(x, y) : (Fin n → α) × (Fin n → β)` is in the set iff the \"reshape\"\x0a`fun i => (x i, y i) : Fin n → α × β` lies in the single-axis strongly typical\x0aset for the joint sequence `jointSequence Xs Ys`.\x0a\x0aConcretely (unfolding `stronglyTypicalSet`):\x0a\x0a  `(x, y) ∈ jointStronglyTypicalSet μ Xs Ys n ε ↔\x0a    ∀ (a, b), |(typeCount (fun i => (x i, y i)) (a, b) : ℝ)/n -\x0a                (μ.map (jointSequence Xs Ys 0)).real {(a, b)}| ≤ ε`. ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Joint strongly typical set over the product alphabet \"],[\"code\",[\"α × β\"]],[\"normal\",\". A pair\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"(x, y) : (Fin n → α) × (Fin n → β)\"]],[\"normal\",\" is in the set iff the \\\"reshape\\\"\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"fun i => (x i, y i) : Fin n → α × β\"]],[\"normal\",\" lies in the single-axis strongly typical\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"set for the joint sequence \"],[\"code\",[\"jointSequence Xs Ys\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Concretely (unfolding \"],[\"code\",[\"stronglyTypicalSet\"]],[\"normal\",\"):\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"(x, y) ∈ jointStronglyTypicalSet μ Xs Ys n ε ↔\",\" \",\"∀ (a, b), |(typeCount (fun i => (x i, y i)) (a, b) : ℝ)/n -\",\" \",\"(μ.map (jointSequence Xs Ys 0)).real {(a, b)}| ≤ ε\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.jointlyTypicalSet_indep_prob_ge", 8044,
   "Anti-direction (lower-bound) joint-AEP indep probability.\x0aThe probability under the product measure `μX^n × μY^n` that `(X̃, Ỹ)` lies in\x0athe jointly typical set is bounded below by `(1 - η) · exp(-n · (I + 3ε))`.\x0a\x0aSee also `jointlyTypicalSet_indep_prob_le`. ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Anti-direction (lower-bound) joint-AEP indep probability.\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"The probability under the product measure \"],[\"code\",[\"μX^n × μY^n\"]],[\"normal\",\" that \"],[\"code\",[\"(X̃, Ỹ)\"]],[\"normal\",\" lies in\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"the jointly typical set is bounded below by \"],[\"code\",[\"(1 - η) · exp(-n · (I + 3ε))\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"See also \"],[\"code\",[\"jointlyTypicalSet_indep_prob_le\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
