   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"For \"],[\"code\",[\"μ := rdAmbient qStar\"]],[\"normal\",\", the entropy difference\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"H(X) + H(Y) − H(Z)\"]],[\"normal\",\" equals \"],[\"code\",[\"mutualInfoPmf qStar\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.RateDistortion.AchievabilityUnconditional module doc 4", 8044,
   "## Marginal-preserving full-support perturbation\x0a\x0aThe strong-typicality achievability theorem requires a strictly-positive optimal\x0ajoint pmf. Starting from a minimizer `qStar ∈ RDConstraint P_X d D` (which may sit\x0aon the boundary of the simplex), we perturb it toward the product `P_X ⊗ uniform_β`,\x0a\x0a  `q'(a, b) := (1 - λ) · qStar(a, b) + λ · P_X(a) / |β|`.\x0a\x0aFor a full-support source `P_X` and `0 < λ ≤ 1` this is strictly positive\x0aeverywhere, keeps the source marginal equal to `P_X`, and — by continuity in `λ`\x0aat `λ = 0` — keeps mutual information below `R` and expected distortion within\x0a`ε/4` of the constraint value. ",
   "[[\"header\",2,[[\"normal\",\"Marginal-preserving full-support perturbation\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The strong-typicality achievability theorem requires a strictly-positive optimal\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"joint pmf. Starting from a minimizer \"],[\"code\",[\"qStar ∈ RDConstraint P_X d D\"]],[\"normal\",\" (which may sit\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"on the boundary of the simplex), we perturb it toward the product \"],[\"code\",[\"P_X ⊗ uniform_β\"]],[\"normal\",\",\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"code\",[\"q'(a, b) := (1 - λ) · qStar(a, b) + λ · P_X(a) / |β|\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"For a full-support source \"],[\"code\",[\"P_X\"]],[\"normal\",\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"0 < λ ≤ 1\"]],[\"normal\",\" this is strictly positive\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"everywhere, keeps the source marginal equal to \"],[\"code\",[\"P_X\"]],[\"normal\",\", and — by continuity in \"],[\"code\",[\"λ\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"at \"],[\"code\",[\"λ = 0\"]],[\"normal\",\" — keeps mutual information below \"],[\"code\",[\"R\"]],[\"normal\",\" and expected distortion within\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"ε/4\"]],[\"normal\",\" of the constraint value.\"]]]]"),
