  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.SlepianWolf.FullRateRegion.PairBound module doc 2", 8044,
   "## Pigeonhole and finalize (Cover–Thomas 15.4.1)\x0a\x0aCombines the four-event decomposition with the per-term binning bounds, takes a total\x0abound over the binning expectation, extracts a deterministic encoder pair by\x0apigeonhole, and derives `error probability → 0` under the rate conditions\x0a`R_X > H(Y|X)`, `R_Y > H(X|Y)`, `R_X + R_Y > H(X, Y)`.\x0a\x0a* `entropy_joint_sub_marginal_eq_condEntropy` — the bridge `H(X,Y) - H(X) = H(Y|X)`.\x0a* `swErrorProb_total_expectation_le` — the total binning-expectation bound.\x0a* `exists_pair_le_of_binning_integral_le` — pigeonhole extraction.\x0a* `slepian_wolf_full_rate_region_achievability` — rate region achievability.\x0a",
