  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.algoet_cover_liminf_bound", 8044,
   "Final transfer to Ω-side: μ-a.s., `entropyRate ≤ liminf blockLogAvg n ω`.\x0a\x0aBridge: `blockLogAvgZ n x` depends only on `natProj x : ℕ → α`. We transfer the\x0aZ-side a.s. liminf bound through `natProj`-`forwardEmbed` measure preservation\x0ato the Ω-side, using `μZ_nat_proj_eq` (= `μ.map forwardEmbed`) and the fact\x0athat `blockLogAvgZ n (eN (forwardEmbed ω)) = blockLogAvg n ω` where\x0a`eN y i := y i.toNat` is the trivial extension on ℤ. ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Final transfer to Ω-side: μ-a.s., \"],[\"code\",[\"entropyRate ≤ liminf blockLogAvg n ω\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Bridge: \"],[\"code\",[\"blockLogAvgZ n x\"]],[\"normal\",\" depends only on \"],[\"code\",[\"natProj x : ℕ → α\"]],[\"normal\",\". We transfer the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"Z-side a.s. liminf bound through \"],[\"code\",[\"natProj\"]],[\"normal\",\"-\"],[\"code\",[\"forwardEmbed\"]],[\"normal\",\" measure preservation\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"to the Ω-side, using \"],[\"code\",[\"μZ_nat_proj_eq\"]],[\"normal\",\" (= \"],[\"code\",[\"μ.map forwardEmbed\"]],[\"normal\",\") and the fact\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"that \"],[\"code\",[\"blockLogAvgZ n (eN (forwardEmbed ω)) = blockLogAvg n ω\"]],[\"normal\",\" where\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"eN y i := y i.toNat\"]],[\"normal\",\" is the trivial extension on ℤ.\"]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.condQk", 8044,
   "The `k`-Markov conditional mass of a length-`ℓ` continuation `w : Fin ℓ → α`\x0aextending a fixed prefix `z : Fin start → α`, defined as the product of\x0a`markovFactor`s at the absolute positions `start, start+1, …, start+ℓ-1`. The tuple\x0afed to each `markovFactor (start+m)` is the combined prefix `Fin.append z (init…w)`\x0arecast to `Fin ((start+m)+1) → α`. At `ℓ = 0` this is `1`; the recursion peels the\x0alast symbol of `w` via `Fin.init`, matching `qkSingleton`'s chain-rule structure so\x0athe product telescopes to `qkSingleton (start+ℓ) / qkSingleton start`. ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The \"],[\"code\",[\"k\"]],[\"normal\",\"-Markov conditional mass of a length-\"],[\"code\",[\"ℓ\"]],[\"normal\",\" continuation \"],[\"code\",[\"w : Fin ℓ → α\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"extending a fixed prefix \"],[\"code\",[\"z : Fin start → α\"]],[\"normal\",\", defined as the product of\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"markovFactor\"]],[\"normal\",\"s at the absolute positions \"],[\"code\",[\"start, start+1, …, start+ℓ-1\"]],[\"normal\",\". The tuple\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"fed to each \"],[\"code\",[\"markovFactor (start+m)\"]],[\"normal\",\" is the combined prefix \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin.append z (init…w)\"]],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"recast to \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin ((start+m)+1) → α\"]],[\"normal\",\". At \"],[\"code\",[\"ℓ = 0\"]],[\"normal\",\" this is \"],[\"code\",[\"1\"]],[\"normal\",\"; the recursion peels the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"last symbol of \"],[\"code\",[\"w\"]],[\"normal\",\" via \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin.init\"]],[\"normal\",\", matching \"],[\"code\",[\"qkSingleton\"]],[\"normal\",\"'s chain-rule structure so\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"the product telescopes to \"],[\"code\",[\"qkSingleton (start+ℓ) / qkSingleton start\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.markovFactor", 8044,
   "The `k`-Markov conditional-kernel mass at the last index of a `Fin (n+1)`-tuple.\x0aFor `n ≤ k`: uses the full prefix `Fin.init y : Fin n → α` and the kernel\x0a`condDistrib (obs n) (blockRV n) μ`. For `n > k`: uses the last `k` symbols of\x0athe prefix (a window indexed `n-k+j`) and the kernel\x0a`condDistrib (obs k) (blockRV k) μ`. ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The \"],[\"code\",[\"k\"]],[\"normal\",\"-Markov conditional-kernel mass at the last index of a \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin (n+1)\"]],[\"normal\",\"-tuple.\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"For \"],[\"code\",[\"n ≤ k\"]],[\"normal\",\": uses the full prefix \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin.init y : Fin n → α\"]],[\"normal\",\" and the kernel\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"condDistrib (obs n) (blockRV n) μ\"]],[\"normal\",\". For \"],[\"code\",[\"n > k\"]],[\"normal\",\": uses the last \"],[\"code\",[\"k\"]],[\"normal\",\" symbols of\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"the prefix (a window indexed \"],[\"code\",[\"n-k+j\"]],[\"normal\",\") and the kernel\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"condDistrib (obs k) (blockRV k) μ\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
