  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.TimeBandLimiting.le_norm_timeLimitProj_sq_of_mem", 8044,
   "Time-window energy concentration: for `v ∈ V = prolateEigenspaceSup T W c` and `0 < c`, the\x0atime-limited energy retains at least the fraction `c` of the total energy:\x0a`c ‖v‖² ≤ ‖Q_T v‖²`, where `Q_T = (timeLimitSubspace T).starProjection`.\x0a\x0aThis is the prolate-spheroidal concentration statement the achievability receiver relies on. It\x0acomes straight from `le_inner_timeBandLimitingOp_of_mem` (the Rayleigh lower bound\x0a`c‖v‖² ≤ ⟪A v, v⟫`) once the polarization identity\x0a`inner_timeBandLimitingOp_eq_inner_timeLimit_bandLimit` collapses\x0a`⟪A v, v⟫` to `‖Q_T P_W v‖²` and `prolateEigenspaceSup_le_bandLimitSubspace` removes `P_W` on `V`.\x0a",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"Time-window energy concentration: for \"],[\"code\",[\"v ∈ V = prolateEigenspaceSup T W c\"]],[\"normal\",\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"0 < c\"]],[\"normal\",\", the\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"time-limited energy retains at least the fraction \"],[\"code\",[\"c\"]],[\"normal\",\" of the total energy:\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"c ‖v‖² ≤ ‖Q_T v‖²\"]],[\"normal\",\", where \"],[\"code\",[\"Q_T = (timeLimitSubspace T).starProjection\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"This is the prolate-spheroidal concentration statement the achievability receiver relies on. It\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"comes straight from \"],[\"code\",[\"le_inner_timeBandLimitingOp_of_mem\"]],[\"normal\",\" (the Rayleigh lower bound\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"c‖v‖² ≤ ⟪A v, v⟫\"]],[\"normal\",\") once the polarization identity\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"inner_timeBandLimitingOp_eq_inner_timeLimit_bandLimit\"]],[\"normal\",\" collapses\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"⟪A v, v⟫\"]],[\"normal\",\" to \"],[\"code\",[\"‖Q_T P_W v‖²\"]],[\"normal\",\" and \"],[\"code\",[\"prolateEigenspaceSup_le_bandLimitSubspace\"]],[\"normal\",\" removes \"],[\"code\",[\"P_W\"]],[\"normal\",\" on \"],[\"code\",[\"V\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]]]"),
  ("InformationTheory.Shannon.TimeBandLimiting.exists_orthonormal_eigenbasis_prolateEigenspaceSup", 8044,
   "An orthonormal eigenbasis of the finite-dimensional `V = prolateEigenspaceSup T W c`, indexed by\x0a`Fin (prolateCount T W c)`, with every eigenvalue exceeding `c`, spanning `V` back in `E`.\x0a\x0aThis is the finite-dimensional spectral theorem applied to `A|_V`; it needs no complete eigenbasis\x0aof `A` on `E`.\x0a\x0aThe index type is `Fin (prolateCount T W c)` *definitionally* (`prolateCount` is the `finrank` of\x0a`V`), which is why no separate multiplicity bridge is needed to match the count.\x0a\x0aThe definitional claim is machine-confirmed, not prose: the body's\x0a`have hn : Module.finrank ℂ (prolateEigenspaceSup T W c) = d := rfl` type-checks, and\x0a`prolateCount T W c := Module.finrank ℂ (prolateEigenspaceSup T W c)` verbatim. sorryAx-free.\x0a@audit:ok ",
   "[[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"An orthonormal eigenbasis of the finite-dimensional \"],[\"code\",[\"V = prolateEigenspaceSup T W c\"]],[\"normal\",\", indexed by\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"Fin (prolateCount T W c)\"]],[\"normal\",\", with every eigenvalue exceeding \"],[\"code\",[\"c\"]],[\"normal\",\", spanning \"],[\"code\",[\"V\"]],[\"normal\",\" back in \"],[\"code\",[\"E\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"This is the finite-dimensional spectral theorem applied to \"],[\"code\",[\"A|_V\"]],[\"normal\",\"; it needs no complete eigenbasis\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"of \"],[\"code\",[\"A\"]],[\"normal\",\" on \"],[\"code\",[\"E\"]],[\"normal\",\".\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The index type is \"],[\"code\",[\"Fin (prolateCount T W c)\"]],[\"normal\",\" \"],[\"em\",[[\"normal\",\"definitionally\"]]],[\"normal\",\" (\"],[\"code\",[\"prolateCount\"]],[\"normal\",\" is the \"],[\"code\",[\"finrank\"]],[\"normal\",\" of\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"V\"]],[\"normal\",\"), which is why no separate multiplicity bridge is needed to match the count.\"]]],[\"p\",[[\"normal\",\"The definitional claim is machine-confirmed, not prose: the body's\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"have hn : Module.finrank ℂ (prolateEigenspaceSup T W c) = d := rfl\"]],[\"normal\",\" type-checks, and\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"code\",[\"prolateCount T W c := Module.finrank ℂ (prolateEigenspaceSup T W c)\"]],[\"normal\",\" verbatim. sorryAx-free.\"],[\"softbr\",\"\\n\"],[\"normal\",\"@audit:ok\"]]]]"),
